Modifications by AGI PROCESOR (procesor.com), 2026:

- The project, Python package, command-line tool, Rust crates, desktop app,
  configuration names, environment variables, identifiers and documentation were
  renamed from OpenJarvis / Jarvis to AGI PROCESOR. Every file in this repository
  may have been changed by that rename; scripts/rebrand/agi_procesor_rebrand.py
  performs it and documents every rule.
- Usage analytics, the savings leaderboard, the desktop auto-updater and the PyPI
  update check no longer contact services of the upstream project; they stay off
  until the owner of an installation configures services of their own.
- Promotional content of the upstream project (a prize giveaway and the
  Showcase of stories from OpenJarvis users) was removed.
- The visual identity (logo, icons, colours, fonts) was replaced with that of
  AGI PROCESOR, and the "inteligencja-agi" configuration preset was added.

CHANGELOG.md is the unmodified history of the upstream project before the rename.
